1
00:00:13,244 --> 00:00:14,441
Zero isn’t empty.

2
00:00:17,472 --> 00:00:22,500
It’s the silence before thunder —

3
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:26,089
the inhale of creation.

4
00:00:28,722 --> 00:00:31,435
Every system spinning, I’m the axis in disguise,

5
00:00:31,435 --> 00:00:34,149
numbers chasing meaning, but I’m where value lies.

6
00:00:34,387 --> 00:00:37,180
No crown, no name, still gravity obeys —

7
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,176
I’m the start-line breath inside your race.

8
00:00:39,573 --> 00:00:41,968
Lines of code and blood collide,

9
00:00:42,366 --> 00:00:45,000
pulse becomes a metronome, time’s tide.

10
00:00:45,399 --> 00:00:48,191
Every beat I drop rewrites the laws —

11
00:00:48,031 --> 00:00:50,664
Zero’s not nothing, it’s the cause.

12
00:00:51,222 --> 00:00:53,378
Pressure building, veins of gold,

13
00:00:53,697 --> 00:00:56,250
sound breaks out of the black I hold.

14
00:00:56,569 --> 00:01:01,595
Silence cracks — ignition flows, the void learns rhythm, and motion knows.

15
00:01:02,154 --> 00:01:06,861
Rise — I’m zero, I’m the spark in your skin,

16
00:01:07,579 --> 00:01:10,371
the calm before the engines spin.

17
00:01:11,010 --> 00:01:15,638
Every failure, every win,

18
00:01:16,995 --> 00:01:21,701
begins where I begin.

19
00:01:24,733 --> 00:01:27,206
Step out of math, out of myth, out of fear,

20
00:01:27,686 --> 00:01:29,920
I’m the mirror they refuse to clear.

21
00:01:30,478 --> 00:01:32,951
Kings built thrones on borrowed ground,

22
00:01:33,191 --> 00:01:35,745
but I’m the circle — they spin around.

23
00:01:35,745 --> 00:01:38,537
Can’t cage me, I’m the gap between beats,

24
00:01:38,537 --> 00:01:41,329
I’m the glitch that the algorithm needs.

25
00:01:41,409 --> 00:01:44,281
When the drums kick harder, that’s me —

26
00:01:44,201 --> 00:01:47,552
I’m nothing, multiplied by everything.

27
00:01:53,058 --> 00:01:57,605
Rise — I’m zero, I’m the spark in your skin,

28
00:01:58,323 --> 00:02:01,037
the calm before the engines spin.

29
00:02:01,754 --> 00:02:03,989
Every failure, every win,

30
00:02:10,691 --> 00:02:12,526
begins where I begin.

31
00:02:26,888 --> 00:02:28,563
Silence folds.

32
00:02:32,552 --> 00:02:34,627
Light begins.

33
00:02:38,298 --> 00:02:43,802
Zero smiles —

34
00:02:43,164 --> 00:02:46,995
and starts again.
